  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "Good afternoon, sir. I am H\xE9ctor Lozano Pe\xF1a. Fifty-four years old. A
    grown man. With a mortgage."
  - The mustache? Yes. It's real. I grew it this morning. ...Over many years. This
    morning I finished.
  - I'm going to El Paso for business. Grown man business. Taxes. And then, after
    the taxes, a concert.
  - Please don't call my wife. She's very strict. She's my mom. My WIFE. She's my
    wife.
  lineIfApproved: 'YES! I mean: thank you, citizen. I will drive safely. As a grown
    man.'
  lineIfRejected: ...Can you not tell my dad? My dad is me. Can you not tell me?
  lineIfImprisoned: I'M SIXTEEN! Okay? I'm sixteen. Please call my mom. Actually,
    don't.
